<section class="page active" id="page-home">
<div class="shell">
<div class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your everyday digital toolkit</div><h1>One Hub.<br><span class="gradient">Many Smart Tools.</span></h1><p>Free, simple and fast tools for images, PDFs, text, QR codes, colors and everyday tasks — right in your browser.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="showPage('tools')">Explore All Tools →</button><button class="btn secondary" onclick="openTool('image')">Try Image Tools</button></div></div>
<div class="hero-art"><span class="float-tag tag1">IMAGE LAB</span><span class="float-tag tag2">PDF TOOLS</span><span class="float-tag tag3">QR STUDIO</span><span class="float-tag tag4">TEXT MAGIC</span><div class="orbit"><div class="hubmark">SSG</div></div></div></div>
<div class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Explore</div><h2>Tools made to save your time</h2><div class="muted">Choose a category to get started.</div></div><input class="searchbar" id="toolSearch" placeholder="Search tools..." oninput="filterTools(this.value)"></div>
<div class="tool-grid" id="toolGrid">
<div class="tool-card" data-search="image resize compress convert photo"><div class="tool-icon">▧</div><h3>Image Tools</h3><p>Resize, compress and convert images locally.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="pdf merge split info print"><div class="tool-icon">▤</div><h3>PDF Tools</h3><p>Inspect, combine and extract PDF pages.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="text word counter case formatter"><div class="tool-icon">T</div><h3>Text Tools</h3><p>Count words, change case and clean text.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="qr code generator"><div class="tool-icon">▦</div><h3>QR Code</h3><p>Create and download QR codes.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="color picker hex rgb"><div class="tool-icon">◉</div><h3>Color Tools</h3><p>Pick colors and convert HEX, RGB and HSL.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="creator hashtags captions social"><div class="tool-icon">✦</div><h3>Creator Tools</h3><p>Generate caption and hashtag ideas.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="web unit converter date calculator text"><div class="tool-icon">⌁</div><h3>Web Utilities</h3><p>Convert units, calculate dates and more.</p></div>
<div class="tool-card" data-search="learning center guides tutorials"><div class="tool-icon">▣</div><h3>Learning Center</h3><p>Helpful guides for smarter digital work.</p></div>
</div>
<div id="toolViews">
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-image"><div class="tool-title"><h2>▧ Image Tools</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="imageTab('resize',this)">Resize</button><button class="tab" onclick="imageTab('compress',this)">Compress</button><button class="tab" onclick="imageTab('convert',this)">Convert</button></div>
<div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><h3>1. Choose an image</h3><label class="field-label">Upload JPG, PNG, or WebP</label><input class="field" type="file" id="imgFile" accept="image/*"><div class="result" id="imgPreview">Your image preview will appear here.</div></div><div class="panel"><h3>2. Adjust and export</h3><div id="imageResizeControls"><div class="row"><div><label class="field-label">Width (px)</label><input class="field" id="imgWidth" type="number" min="1" placeholder="Width"></div><div><label class="field-label">Height (px)</label><input class="field" id="imgHeight" type="number" min="1" placeholder="Height"></div></div><label><input type="checkbox" id="imgLock" checked> Keep aspect ratio</label></div><div id="imageCompressControls" class="hidden"><label class="field-label">Quality <span id="qualityValue">80%</span></label><input class="field" id="imgQuality" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="80" oninput="qualityValue.textContent=this.value+'%'"><label class="field-label">Maximum width (optional)</label><input class="field" id="imgMaxWidth" class="field" type="number" placeholder="e.g. 1600"></div><div id="imageConvertControls" class="hidden"><label class="field-label">Output format</label><select class="field" id="imgFormat"><option value="image/png">PNG</option><option value="image/jpeg">JPG</option><option value="image/webp">WebP</option></select><label class="field-label">Quality (JPG/WebP)</label><input class="field" id="convertQuality" type="range" min="10" max="100" value="90"></div><button class="btn" onclick="processImage()">Process Image</button><div class="status" id="imgStatus"></div><div class="result" id="imgResult">Processed image will appear here.</div></div></div><p class="notice">Images are processed on your device in this browser. Nothing is uploaded to an SSG server.</p></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-pdf"><div class="tool-title"><h2>▤ PDF Tools</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><h3>PDF information</h3><input class="field" type="file" id="pdfInfoFile" accept="application/pdf"><button class="btn small" onclick="pdfInfo()">Read PDF Info</button><div class="result" id="pdfInfoResult">Choose a PDF to inspect its size and page count.</div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Merge PDF files</h3><input class="field" type="file" id="pdfMergeFiles" accept="application/pdf" multiple><button class="btn small" onclick="mergePDF()">Merge & Download</button><div class="status" id="pdfMergeStatus"></div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Extract pages</h3><input class="field" type="file" id="pdfExtractFile" accept="application/pdf"><label class="field-label">Pages (e.g. 1,3,5-7)</label><input class="field" id="pdfPages" placeholder="1,3,5-7"><button class="btn small" onclick="extractPDF()">Extract & Download</button><div class="status" id="pdfExtractStatus"></div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Print or save as PDF</h3><p class="muted">Open a PDF with your browser's built-in viewer, then use Print → Save as PDF.</p><input class="field" type="file" id="pdfOpenFile" accept="application/pdf"><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="openPDF()">Open PDF</button></div></div><p class="notice">PDF merge and page extraction use the free open-source PDF-Lib browser library loaded from a public CDN. Your selected files are processed locally.</p></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-text"><div class="tool-title"><h2>T Text Tools</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="panel"><label class="field-label">Enter or paste your text</label><textarea class="field" id="textInput" rows="8" placeholder="Type or paste text here..." oninput="updateTextStats()"></textarea><div class="row"><button class="btn small" onclick="changeCase('upper')">UPPERCASE</button><button class="btn small" onclick="changeCase('lower')">lowercase</button><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="changeCase('title')">Title Case</button><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="cleanText()">Clean Spaces</button><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="copyText()">Copy</button></div><div class="result" id="textStats">Words: 0 · Characters: 0 · Sentences: 0 · Reading time: 0 min</div><div class="status" id="textStatus"></div></div></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-qr"><div class="tool-title"><h2>▦ QR Code Generator</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><label class="field-label">Text or website URL</label><textarea class="field" id="qrText" rows="4" placeholder="https://example.com"></textarea><label class="field-label">QR size</label><select class="field" id="qrSize"><option value="180">180 × 180</option><option value="256" selected>256 × 256</option><option value="360">360 × 360</option></select><button class="btn" onclick="makeQR()">Generate QR Code</button><div class="status" id="qrStatus"></div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Your QR code</h3><div class="result" id="qrResult" style="text-align:center;min-height:210px">QR code will appear here.</div><button class="btn small" onclick="downloadQR()">Download PNG</button></div></div><p class="notice">QR generation uses a free open-source browser library loaded from a public CDN.</p></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-color"><div class="tool-title"><h2>◉ Color Tools</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><label class="field-label">Choose a color</label><input type="color" id="colorPicker" value="#31e6f2" class="field" style="height:65px;padding:5px" oninput="syncColor('picker')"><label class="field-label">HEX value</label><input class="field" id="hexColor" value="#31e6f2" oninput="syncColor('hex')"><button class="btn small" onclick="copyValue('hexColor')">Copy HEX</button></div><div class="panel"><h3>Color values</h3><div class="result" id="colorSwatch" style="height:70px;background:#31e6f2"></div><div class="result" id="colorValues">RGB and HSL values</div></div></div></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-creator"><div class="tool-title"><h2>✦ Creator Tools</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><h3>Caption ideas</h3><input class="field" id="captionTopic" placeholder="Topic, product or post idea"><select class="field" id="captionTone"><option>Friendly</option><option>Professional</option><option>Funny</option><option>Inspirational</option></select><button class="btn small" onclick="makeCaption()">Generate caption</button><div class="result" id="captionResult">Your caption ideas will appear here.</div><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="copyResult('captionResult')">Copy</button></div><div class="panel"><h3>Hashtag ideas</h3><input class="field" id="hashTopic" placeholder="e.g. travel, food, fitness"><button class="btn small" onclick="makeHashtags()">Generate hashtags</button><div class="result" id="hashResult">Hashtags will appear here.</div><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="copyResult('hashResult')">Copy</button></div></div><p class="notice">Creator suggestions are generated from simple on-device templates, not an AI service.</p></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-web"><div class="tool-title"><h2>⌁ Web Utilities</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="webTab('unit',this)">Unit Converter</button><button class="tab" onclick="webTab('date',this)">Date Calculator</button><button class="tab" onclick="webTab('case',this)">Text Utilities</button></div><div id="web-unit" class="panel"><label class="field-label">Convert</label><div class="row"><input class="field" id="unitValue" type="number" value="1"><select class="field" id="unitFrom"><option value="km">Kilometers</option><option value="mi">Miles</option><option value="m">Meters</option><option value="ft">Feet</option><option value="kg">Kilograms</option><option value="lb">Pounds</option><option value="c">Celsius</option><option value="f">Fahrenheit</option><option value="l">Liters</option><option value="gal">US Gallons</option></select><span>to</span><select class="field" id="unitTo"><option value="mi">Miles</option><option value="km">Kilometers</option><option value="ft">Feet</option><option value="m">Meters</option><option value="lb">Pounds</option><option value="kg">Kilograms</option><option value="f">Fahrenheit</option><option value="c">Celsius</option><option value="gal">US Gallons</option><option value="l">Liters</option></select></div><button class="btn small" onclick="convertUnit()">Convert</button><div class="result" id="unitResult">Result appears here.</div></div><div id="web-date" class="panel hidden"><h3>Date calculator</h3><label class="field-label">Start date</label><input class="field" id="dateStart" type="date"><label class="field-label">End date</label><input class="field" id="dateEnd" type="date"><button class="btn small" onclick="dateDifference()">Calculate difference</button><div class="result" id="dateResult">Choose two dates.</div><hr style="border-color:var(--line);margin:18px 0"><label class="field-label">Add days to a date</label><div class="row"><input class="field" id="addDate" type="date"><input class="field" id="addDays" type="number" value="30"></div><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="addDateDays()">Calculate new date</button><div class="result" id="addDateResult"></div></div><div id="web-case" class="panel hidden"><h3>Text utilities</h3><textarea class="field" id="utilityText" rows="4" placeholder="Enter text"></textarea><div class="row"><button class="btn small" onclick="reverseText()">Reverse text</button><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="sortLines()">Sort lines A–Z</button><button class="btn small secondary" onclick="removeDuplicates()">Remove duplicate lines</button></div><div class="result" id="utilityResult"></div></div></section>
<section class="tool-view" id="tool-learning"><div class="tool-title"><h2>▣ Learning Center</h2><button onclick="closeTools()">✕ Close</button></div><div class="tool-panels"><div class="panel"><h3>How to compress an image</h3><ol><li>Open Image Tools → Compress.</li><li>Select your image from your device.</li><li>Choose a quality level and optional maximum width.</li><li>Press Process Image, then download the result.</li></ol></div><div class="panel"><h3>How to create a QR code</h3><ol><li>Open QR Code Generator.</li><li>Enter text or a full website address.</li><li>Choose a size and generate the code.</li><li>Download the PNG and test it with your phone camera.</li></ol></div><div class="panel"><h3>Keep your files private</h3><p>Image and text tools work inside your browser. Avoid using public or shared devices for private files, and close the tab when finished.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>PDF tips</h3><p>Use page numbers such as <b>1,3,5-7</b> to extract selected pages. When merging, choose files in the order you want them combined.</p></div></div></section>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-tools"><div class="shell section"><div class="eyebrow">Tool directory</div><h2>All SSG SMART HUB Tools</h2><p class="muted">Select any category below to open its tools.</p><div class="tool-grid" id="allToolGrid"></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-about"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">About SSG SMART HUB</div><h2>Simple tools for everyday digital tasks</h2><p>SSG SMART HUB is designed to bring useful everyday utilities together in one clean, mobile-friendly place. Our goal is to make common tasks easy, fast and accessible without requiring an account.</p><h3>Our approach</h3><ul><li>Browser-based processing wherever practical.</li><li>No user account or profile required.</li><li>Clear, straightforward tools with simple controls.</li><li>Responsive experience for phones, tablets and computers.</li></ul><p>Some optional features may load open-source libraries from public content delivery networks. A network connection may be required for those features.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-contact"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">Contact</div><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>Have feedback or found a problem? Use the form below to prepare an email in your email application.</p><label class="field-label">Website contact email (owner must configure)</label><input class="field" id="contactTo" type="email" placeholder="site-owner@example.com"><label class="field-label">Your email (optional)</label><input class="field" id="contactEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"><label class="field-label">Subject</label><input class="field" id="contactSubject" placeholder="Feedback or support"><label class="field-label">Message</label><textarea class="field" id="contactMessage" rows="5" placeholder="Write your message..."></textarea><button class="btn" onclick="sendContact()">Open email app</button><p class="notice">This demo form does not send or store messages on a server. It opens your device's email application.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-privacy"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">Legal information</div><h2>Privacy Policy</h2><p><b>Last updated: November 2026</b></p><p>SSG SMART HUB is intended to provide browser-based utilities. We do not require users to create accounts or submit personal profiles to use the tools.</p><h3>Files and text you use</h3><p>Image, text and other local tools are designed to process your selected content in your browser. The site does not intentionally upload those files to an SSG server. Some features may load open-source libraries from third-party content delivery networks; those providers may receive standard technical request information.</p><h3>Cookies and advertising</h3><p>If advertising or analytics services are added in the future, this policy must be updated to explain the providers, cookies, data use and available choices before those services are activated. No advertising or analytics code is included in this starter build.</p><h3>Children and contact</h3><p>The site is a general-purpose utility website and is not designed to collect information from children. Contact us using the email link on the Contact page.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-terms"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">Legal information</div><h2>Terms & Conditions</h2><p><b>Last updated: November 2026</b></p><p>By using SSG SMART HUB, you agree to use the website lawfully and responsibly. The tools are provided for general convenience and may change as the site is improved.</p><h3>No warranty</h3><p>The website and tools are provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. We do not guarantee uninterrupted operation, accuracy or suitability for a particular purpose.</p><h3>Your responsibility</h3><p>Keep your own backup of important files. Check converted or generated results before relying on them. Do not use the website to violate laws or the rights of others.</p><h3>Changes</h3><p>These terms may be updated as the website evolves. Continued use after an update means you accept the revised terms.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-disclaimer"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><h2>Disclaimer</h2><p>SSG SMART HUB tools are provided for general informational and productivity purposes. Results may vary depending on your browser, device, file format and input. Always verify important outputs independently. Nothing on this website constitutes legal, financial, medical or professional advice.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="page" id="page-cookies"><div class="shell section"><div class="prose"><h2>Cookie Policy</h2><p>This build does not intentionally set advertising or analytics cookies. Browser features and third-party libraries may use standard browser storage or network requests as required for operation. If cookies or tracking tools are introduced later, this page must be updated with details and consent choices where required by law.</p></div></div></section>
